# ── Dataset Download Instructions ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# DATASET: UCI Student Performance Data Set (Cortez & Silva, 2008)
# OFFICIAL UCI PAGE: https://archive.ics.uci.edu/ml/datasets/student+performance
#
# DOWNLOAD FROM KAGGLE:
#   URL: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/uciml/student-alcohol-consumption
#
#   ⚠️  NOTE ON THE CONFUSING KAGGLE NAME:
#   The Kaggle upload is titled "Student Alcohol Consumption" — this is misleading.
#   It IS the correct UCI Student Performance dataset. The uploader named it after
#   the Dalc/Walc (alcohol) columns, but the dataset is primarily about student
#   academic performance (grades G1, G2, G3, absences, study time, failures, etc.)
#
# AFTER DOWNLOADING:
#   1. Unzip the Kaggle download
#   2. Copy student-mat.csv to this folder  ← Mathematics course, 395 students
#   3. Optionally also copy student-por.csv ← Portuguese course, 649 students
#
# FILE FORMAT:
#   Separator: semicolon (;)  ← NOT comma — load with pd.read_csv(..., sep=';')
#   Encoding: UTF-8
#
# ALTERNATIVE DIRECT DOWNLOAD:
#   https://archive.ics.uci.edu/static/public/320/student+performance.zip
#   Extract student.zip → get student-mat.csv and student-por.csv
